WEBVTT

00:03:59.796 --> 00:04:01.036
and get cheaper

00:04:01.036 --> 00:04:03.196
to accommodate
global economic development.

00:04:03.236 --> 00:04:06.596
Based on projections of global
development by 2050,

00:04:06.596 --> 00:04:10.196
generation needed rises to 60
petawatt hours per year.

00:04:11.756 --> 00:04:14.036
The third reason is a bit more debatable,

00:04:14.036 --> 00:04:16.716
but it needs to be talked about
more in public discourse.

00:04:16.756 --> 00:04:17.996
It has to do with the fact

00:04:18.036 --> 00:04:20.836
that not everything
can be electrified by 2050.

00:04:20.836 --> 00:04:22.556
Long-range airplanes, for instance,

00:04:22.556 --> 00:04:25.396
are still going to need the energy
density of a liquid fuel.

00:04:25.396 --> 00:04:27.556
Similar for some industrial processes.

